B.aeS=new A.cO("Sistema inmunol\xf3gico","Red de c\xe9lulas, tejidos y \xf3rganos que ayuda al cuerpo a defenderse y mantener equilibrio interno.","The network of cells, tissues, and organs that helps the body defend itself and maintain internal balance.")
B.af9=new A.cO("Respaldo inmunol\xf3gico","Apoyo nutricional dirigido a mantener las funciones normales de defensa del cuerpo.","Nutritional support aimed at maintaining the body\u2019s normal defense functions.")
